# =============================================================================
# NAMESPACE — hand-written, not roxygen2-generated.
#
# The dev container this package was authored in does not have roxygen2 /
# devtools installed, and this package is small and stable enough that
# hand-maintaining this file is less risky than adding a build dependency.
# If you add a new exported function or a new bare (unqualified) call to a
# non-base package inside R/*.R, update this file by hand to match — running
# devtools::document() will DELETE these entries and regenerate from roxygen
# tags, which do not exist here, silently breaking the package.
# =============================================================================

# ---- Exports — callable from a study's report_spec.R via library() --------
